{
  "name": "Budget Reviews",
  "description": "The Monday budget review an agent writes from the records above: the projected overrun, open purchase orders, which cost centers are at risk and why, which forecasts are stale.",
  "position": 3,
  "agentPrompts": [
    {
      "key": "write-review",
      "label": {
        "en": "Write this Monday’s budget review",
        "zh-CN": "写本周一的预算周报"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "Read the `busa-budget` skill in this folder and follow it. Write the budget review for last Monday to Sunday from the cost centers, signals and actions: a one-line headline, the projected overrun, open purchase orders, how many cost centers are on track, every at-risk cost center with what is wrong and the action, every forecast older than 30 days, and what changed since last week. Save it as a draft.",
        "zh-CN": "先阅读本文件夹里的 `busa-budget` Skill，按它的规则做。根据部门、信号和措施，写上周一到周日的预算周报：一句话结论、全年预计超支、未付采购单、正常部门数、每个有风险部门的问题和对应措施、超过 30 天没更新的预测、与上周相比的变化。保存为草稿。"
      },
      "intent": "change"
    },
    {
      "key": "compare-weeks",
      "label": {
        "en": "What got better or worse since last week?",
        "zh-CN": "和上周比哪些变好了、哪些变差了"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "Read the `busa-budget` skill in this folder and follow it. Compare the two latest reviews and the signals between them: the projected overrun, open purchase orders, which cost centers changed status, and which actions closed. Do not change anything.",
        "zh-CN": "先阅读本文件夹里的 `busa-budget` Skill，按它的规则做。对比最近两份周报和期间的信号：全年预计超支、未付采购单、哪些部门换了状态、哪些措施完成了。不要修改任何记录。"
      },
      "intent": "read-only"
    }
  ],
